The browser adaptation keeps Pi's display-diff parsing, three-space tab
expansion, replacement-group detection, and diffWords behavior. Terminal
theme/ANSI rendering is replaced with DOM rows and spans created with
createElement and textContent. The adaptation is limited to the settled edit
result renderer; it does not copy Pi's filesystem preview or interactive TUI.

The word-diff primitive is copied from:
  diff/jsdiff 8.0.4 browser UMD build: dist/diff.min.js
  Source asset: web/vendor/jsdiff.min.js
  License: BSD-3-Clause; complete notice is in web/vendor/jsdiff.LICENSE.

